- kb/sources/transformers-learn-in-context-by-gradient-descent.ingest.md — Ingest: Transformers Learn In-Context by Gradient Descent — Mechanistic ICML paper showing in-context regression can be implemented as gradient descent inside Transformer forward passes, sharpening the internal half of the KB's in-context-learning theory
